page('privacy','Privacy Notice',intro('YOUR INFORMATION','Privacy, in plain language.','This notice explains how the enquiry forms on this website use your information.')+'<section class="wrap prose"><h2>What you share</h2><p>We collect your name, phone number, optional email address and the information you enter about an outfit or training enquiry. Academy enquiries may also include experience and accommodation preferences.</p><h2>Why it is collected</h2><p>GFA uses this information to respond to your request and discuss the service or training you asked about. Submitting a form does not subscribe you to marketing.</p><h2>Where it is stored</h2><p>Enquiries are stored in GFA’s Supabase database in Europe. Access is restricted to authorised staff. Do not submit payment card information, passwords or sensitive identity documents.</p><h2>WhatsApp and social links</h2><p>Opening WhatsApp, Instagram or TikTok takes you to a separate service with its own privacy practices. Those services may process the information you choose to share there.</p><h2>Your choices</h2><p>To request a correction or deletion of your enquiry, contact GFA on <a href="https://wa.me/2349034699140">WhatsApp</a>. You can enquire directly there instead of using a form.</p><h2>Website storage</h2><p>Public enquiry forms do not use advertising trackers or store your message in your browser. Staff sign-in stores a session locally until sign-out.</p></section>')
